id: tranquil-mark
name: Tranquil
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: says the Mindful State was entered by Tranquil Warrior's (2), for one Maneuver.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Tranquil Warrior: in the Mindful State for this Maneuver - left once it is concluded.
text: >
  Tranquil Warrior (2): When you use an Attacking Maneuver or Counter Maneuver, you may enter the Mindful State for the duration of that Maneuver.

---
